{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、元気にお過ごしでしょーか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新なかなか出来なくてごめんなさい（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今、頑張っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう聞いて聞いてっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、最近の時計のゾロ目を見る回数がやばいの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デジタル時計だと秒数も出てるでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その何時何分何秒が全部ゾロ目になってる時に偶然時計を見るのがめちゃくちゃ多いのよ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に私がよく見る数字が、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22.22。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと最近だと、11.11.11。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなのが一日に5回くらいあるときも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、ちょっと怖くなったから調べてみたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゾロ目をよく見る意味って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく見る数字によって意味が違うらしいんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22.22.22の意味は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「奇跡が起きる5分前」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ...やばいっ奇跡って...えっ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高まるーこれはなんでもかんでも頑張らなければならぬよねこれー高まるー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくこれは何かがおきそうな予感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思って頑張っております。能條です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなゾロ目ガールな私は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日シネマサンシャイン池袋にて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「BAD BOYS J―最後 に守るもの―」の舞台挨拶に参加させていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで裏話トークなどなどをした後、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイタッチ会❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな笑顔でかっこよかったよーなどたくさんの声をいただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/11/10/8854829/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装はドラマの時と同じ。金と黒って感じのやつね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークをしてる時、懐かしさにかられましたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の時は毎回ひたすら寒かった。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにもかくにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月9日\nBAD BOYS Ｊ ー最後に守るものー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、是非劇場に足をお運び下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは、すこーし次のお仕事まで暇になったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香と若月とずっきゅんと一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ずっきゅんって真夏ね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しばかりティーが飲めるとこでお話しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーそこで出会った白熊ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/11/10/8854829/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氷がふわっふわしててめーっちゃ美味かったー❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまうまくんひひーん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぎうぎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてやはり女子トークとはいくら時間があっても尽きないものですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん真面目な話もしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しましたけど結局最後の1時間は終始腹をかかえて大爆笑で終わりました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが女子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ティーと時間とそれから少々甘いものがあればいくらだって語れますよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日はうまズキッ！の歌収録でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うまズキッ！また出させていただけて光栄です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲 バレッタ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/11/10/8854829/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左耳辺りにちゃっかりしっかりバレッタもつけてるんですよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非観て下さいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/11/10/8854829/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょーず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーが夢の国行きたいと叫びながら訴えて